Specifics of the weight_log file:

1. Comments
'#' symbol is used for comments
All characters to the right of # are ignored, until newline \n

Example:
# This is commented
2027-09-24 66.8 # This is commented


2. Log entries
YYYY-MM-DD Weight(kg) in the following format:
2027-09-29 70.0

The logs do not have to be day by day (you can skip days)
They don't have to be in order either
2027-09-29 70.0
2027-09-30 69.9

2027-10-02 63.9
